Changes made for hass-kiwee (Apache-2.0, section 4b):
- renamed the integration, package and entities for Kiwee Broadband MoCA adapters
- rewrote the adapter API client: POST requests with JSON bodies and CSRF cookie/header,
  node table, PHY rate calculation, channel plan, Ethernet counters and settings as used by
  the adapters' own web pages
- added sensors (channels, Tx/Beacon power, Preferred NC, per-peer TX good packets)
- added tools, documentation and tests

Every modified source file carries a notice at the top.
